                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "TL;DR:\n+ This game COULD HAVE been amazing, but due to technical issues its a pain to play, therefore i would not really recommend playing it.\nIf you do - SAVE as often as possible.\n\nMore info:\n- From the beginning, the game does not load until you google a bit and change its settings to 32b.\nThen you feel that it is not so bad, just 1 issue, which you solved and now you can peacefully play.\n\n- Guess again, because about some time after (~30 minutes) the game will crash.\nOpening it again does not retain where you were, unless you manually SAVED AND QUIT.\n\n- Yup, \"saved and quit\", because apparently you cannot choose to only \"save\", you have to also quit and experience the fun of staring at the intro screen, again and again.\n\n- At this point you will realize that this is not really a viable and fun way to play, but you are already in too deep, so you would just blindlessly follow a walkthrough guide.",
